*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0041
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-09-12 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-01 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 941
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0041.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0041C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> PENALTY WAIVER FLAG
    05 WAIVER-IND         PIC X VALUE 'N'.
        88 WAIVER-WAIVED VALUE 'Y'.
    *> LATE PAYMENT PENALTY
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM WAIVE-PENALTY
    DISPLAY "WAIVER-IND=" WAIVER-IND
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-PENALTY.
    IF FIRST-FIRST-TIME
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> PREMIUM FIRST-OFFENCE WAIVER
            WHEN CUSTOMER-TIER = 'G' OR CUSTOMER-TIER = 'P'
                SET WAIVER-WAIVED TO TRUE
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
            *> GRACE PERIOD WAIVER
            WHEN DAYS-LATE <= 3
                SET WAIVER-WAIVED TO TRUE
                MOVE 0 TO LATE-CHARGE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
